margin-top: 0; }\np, li { orphans: 2; widows: 2; }\n\n@media screen {\n  html { background: transparent; }\n  .page {\n    width: 210.0mm;\n    min-height: 297.0mm;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 12.7mm;\n    background: #fff;\n  }\n}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"page\">\n  <header class=\"cv-header\" data-id=\"header\"><h1 class=\"name\">Jane Doe</h1><p class=\"headline\">Senior Data Engineer</p>    <p class=\"contacts\"><span class=\"contact\" data-id=\"ctc_1\"><a href=\"tel:+6281234567890\">+62 812 3456 7890</a></span><span class=\"sep\"> | </span><span class=\"contact\" data-id=\"ctc_2\"><a href=\"mailto:jane.doe@example.com\">jane.doe@example.com</a></span><span class=\"sep\"> | </span><span class=\"contact\" data-id=\"ctc_3\">Jakarta, Indonesia</span><span class=\"sep\"> | </span><span class=\"contact\" data-id=\"ctc_4\"><a href=\"https://github.com/janedoe\">github.com/janedoe</a></span></p>  </header>  <section class=\"section untitled\" data-id=\"sec_sum\" data-type=\"summary\"><p class=\"text\">Data engineer with eight years of experience building analytics platforms.\nFocused on reliable pipelines.</p>  </section>  <section class=\"section\" data-id=\"sec_exp\" data-type=\"experience\">    <h2 class=\"section-title\">EXPERIENCE <a href=\"https://github.com/janedoe/\">[ github.com/janedoe ]</a></h2>    <div class=\"item\" data-id=\"itm_acme\">      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"title\">Acme Corp, Data Engineer</span><span class=\"right date\">Jan 2022 - Present</span></div>      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"subtitle\">Platform Team</span><span class=\"right location\">Remote</span></div>      <ul class=\"bullets\"><li data-id=\"blt_1\">Built a streaming pipeline that cut reporting latency by 40%.</li><li data-id=\"blt_2\">Responsible for the nightly batch jobs</li><li data-id=\"blt_3\">Led a team of 5 engineers to migrate 120 dashboards.</li><li data-id=\"blt_4\">I helped with things</li></ul>    </div>    <div class=\"item\" data-id=\"itm_globex\">      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"title\">Globex</span></div>      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"subtitle\">Analyst</span></div>      <ul class=\"bullets\"><li data-id=\"blt_5\">Worked on ad-hoc reports for the sales, finance, marketing, operations, legal and executive teams across three regions every single week of the year without fail ever</li></ul>    </div>    <div class=\"item\" data-id=\"itm_initech\">      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"title\">Initech</span><span class=\"right date\">2018</span></div>      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"subtitle\">Intern</span></div>    </div>  </section>  <section class=\"section\" data-id=\"sec_edu\" data-type=\"education\">    <h2 class=\"section-title\">EDUCATION</h2>    <div class=\"item\" data-id=\"itm_uni\">      <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"title\">State University, BSc Computer Science</span><span class=\"right date\">2015 - 2019</span></div><p class=\"line\" data-id=\"lin_1\">GPA: 3.8/4</p>    </div>  </section>  <section class=\"section\" data-id=\"sec_skl\" data-type=\"skills\">    <h2 class=\"section-title\">SKILLS</h2><p class=\"text\">Languages: Python, SQL, Go\nTools: Airflow, dbt, Docker</p>  </section></main>\n</body>\n</html>",
